#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/agentInstallation.rst:33
msgid ""
"The Morpheus Agent can be installed with a variety of automated methods. "
"It is important to note these methods simply get the Agent install script"
" to the target. Successful execution of the Agent install script is not "
"directly related to the Agent install method."
msgstr ""
"El Agente Morpheus puede instalarse con una variedad de métodos "
"automatizados. Es importante tener en cuenta these methods simply get the "
"Agent install script to el objetivo. Successful execution of the Agent "
"install script is no directly relacionado con the Agent install method."

